None of the above.  Protect that potion by keeping it in a bag.  #dip the
unicorn horn in the 'bad' potions you find, then #dip the lot.  Dipping
10 potions of water of water gives you 10 potions of Holy Water.  Use up
9 and save the last.  Repeat the above procedure for the remainder of the
game.  It's more convenient than waiting to find alters.

